WEBVTT

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:01.296
No, let's pick a prime number
higher than 10.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.040
Seventeen goals.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.896
I congratulate those of you
who've memorized them already.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.056
For the rest of us, here they are.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:12.096
Seventeen goals ranging
from ending poverty

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:13.496
to inclusive cities

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.336
to sustainable fisheries;

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.800
all a comprehensive plan
for the future of our world.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:23.440
But sadly, a plan
without the data to measure it.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:26.090
So how are we going to track progress?

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:30.776
Well, I'm going to use today
the Social Progress Index.